        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[新竹]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>呃...新竹...離我家好遠啊...好遠好遠 坐車好痛苦，走到學校的那段路更痛苦</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">車站裡</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">獨自閉上眼</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">感受告別和相遇</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">太過幸福於是我開始逃跑</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">尋找黑暗與寂寞</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">那才是屬於我的東西</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">抵達另個城市</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">熟悉的令人痛苦</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">一步一步都像在處罰</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">回憶重播眼前</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">沈重的腳步</span><br></div><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">看不到前方的路</span><br></div></code></pre></div></div>
